    <item>
      <title>Performance Monitors</title>
      <link>/core/linux/performance/performance-monitor/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/core/linux/performance/performance-monitor/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Ref:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.thegeekstuff.com/2011/12/linux-performance-monitoring-tools/&#34;&gt;The Geek Stuff - Performance Monitoring Toools&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.brendangregg.com/linuxperf.html&#34;&gt;Brendan&amp;rsquo;s Linux Performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;wslubuntu&#34;&gt;WSL/ubuntu&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;perf&lt;/code&gt; doesn&amp;rsquo;t work after installing in WSL2/ubuntu.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-text&#34; data-lang=&#34;text&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;sudo apt install linux-oem-5.6-tools-common&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;perf&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;WARNING: perf not found for kernel 4.19.128-microsoft&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  You may need to install the following packages for this specific kernel:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    linux-tools-4.19.128-microsoft-standard&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    linux-cloud-tools-4.19.128-microsoft-standard&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  You may also want to install one of the following packages to keep up to date:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    linux-tools-standard&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    linux-cloud-tools-standard&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;No lucks to install &lt;code&gt;linux-tools-4.19.128-microsoft-standard&lt;/code&gt;, not build from &lt;a href=&#34;https://mirrors.edge.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/tools/perf&#34;&gt;microsoft perf source&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
